# Unit22
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit22核心词汇

destiny/ˈdestɪni/命运/She believed that destiny brought them together.
detect/dɪˈtekt/探测/The sensor can detect tiny changes.
determine/dɪˈtɜːrmɪn/决定/Hard work determines success.
devise/dɪˈvaɪz/设计/She devised a plan to increase sales.
devote/dɪˈvoʊt/致力于/She devoted all her energy to the project.
diagnose/ˈdaɪəɡnoʊz/诊断/The doctor diagnosed the illness quickly.
dimension/daɪˈmenʃn/维度/The problem has many dimensions.
diminish/dɪˈmɪnɪʃ/减少/The importance should not be diminished.
discipline/ˈdɪsəplɪn/纪律；学科/Mathematics is a rigorous discipline.
disclose/dɪsˈkloʊz/披露/The company refused to disclose data.
discriminate/dɪˈskrɪmɪneɪt/歧视/It is illegal to discriminate.
dismiss/dɪˈsmɪs/解雇/The court dismissed the case.
dispose/dɪˈspoʊz/处理/Please dispose of waste properly.
dispute/dɪˈspjuːt/争端/They are involved in a territorial dispute.
distinct/dɪˈstɪŋkt/不同的/There are two distinct approaches.
distinguish/dɪˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ/区分/It's hard to distinguish the twins.
distribute/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt/分配/The food was distributed to victims.
diverse/daɪˈvɜːrs/多样的/The city has a diverse population.
dividend/ˈdɪvɪdend/红利/Shareholders received a dividend.
division/dɪˈvɪʒn/分割；部门/She works in the marketing division.
document/ˈdɑːkjumənt/文件/Please read the document carefully.
domestic/dəˈmestɪk/国内的/Domestic flights are cheaper.
dominant/ˈdɑːmɪnənt/占主导的/English is dominant in business.
donate/doʊˈneɪt/捐赠/She donated money to charity.
dose/doʊs/剂量/Take the medicine in the correct dose.
draft/dræft/草稿/He wrote the first draft of his novel.
drastic/ˈdræstɪk/激烈的/Drastic measures are needed.
drift/drɪft/漂流/The boat drifted down the river.
drought/draʊt/干旱/The drought destroyed crops.
durable/ˈdjʊrəbl/耐用的/This bag is made of durable material.
duration/djuˈreɪʃn/持续时间/The flight duration is three hours.
dynamic/daɪˈnæmɪk/动态的/She is a dynamic leader.
eager/ˈiːɡər/渴望的/He is eager to learn.
ease/iːz/缓解/The new technology will ease the workload.
edition/ɪˈdɪʃn/版本/This is the third edition.
editorial/ˌedɪˈtɔːriəl/社论/The newspaper published an editorial.
elaborate/ɪˈlæbərət/精心制作的/She gave an elaborate presentation.
elegant/ˈelɪɡənt/优雅的/She wore an elegant dress.
eliminate/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt/消除/We need to eliminate unnecessary costs.
embrace/ɪmˈbreɪs/拥抱；接受/She embraced the new challenge.
emerge/ɪˈmɜːrdʒ/出现/New problems emerged during discussion.
emission/ɪˈmɪʃn/排放/We must reduce carbon emissions.
empire/ˈempaɪər/帝国/The Roman Empire was once powerful.
enable/ɪˈneɪbl/使能够/The system enables faster processing.
enhance/ɪnˈhæns/增强/Technology can enhance learning.
enthusiasm/ɪnˈθuːziæzəm/热情/She showed great enthusiasm.
entitle/ɪnˈtaɪtl/给…权利/Every citizen is entitled to healthcare.
entrepreneur/ˌɑːntrəprəˈnɜːr/企业家/She is a successful entrepreneur.
entry/ˈentri/进入；条目/There is no entry without a pass.
epidemic/ˌepɪˈdemɪk/流行病/The epidemic spread rapidly.
